TI  - Regression-style models for parameter estimation in dynamic microsimulation: An empirical performance assessment
AU  - McLay, Jessica M
AU  - Lay-Yee, Roy
AU  - Milne, Barry J
AU  - Davis, Peter
VL  - 8
IS  - 2
PY  - 2015
DA  - 2015/08/31
